      "id": 1,
      "text": "North Loup began in 1872 when Seventh‑Day Baptists from Wisconsin founded a religious colony seeking a quiet place to observe the Sabbath.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
